The primary point of this repository is to make a fancier interface for
different systems and the Gillespie algorithm. It always bugged me during my
MSc that I had the algorithms working and was discouraged from improving the
interfaces for fear of changing the code's behaviour.

Once the interfaces are working nicely, I think I'll try playing with the
fluctuation-dissipation theorem ideas people had, to see if I can make any
progress there. I will already have the autocovariance ideas ready, I just need
to figure out the fluctuation-dissipation side of things.
